                                                "sense_id": "cc3ff13e-f8b2-32a7-96bd-c099e09dca7a",
                                                "text": "If your promiscuous, men who know females just date around could take advantage of that, plus a lot wouldn't want to cuff a female they know isn't doing pure things."
